Description:
The Beretta 92 is a symbol of excellence in italian arms manufacturing, with it's high capacity and sleek, elegant shape.
While effective enough on it's own, nothing compares to the feeling of unloading two at once.
It'll cost you in accuracy and reload speed, but the firerate and mag capacity will more than make up for it.
If holding one of these makes you feel like Superman, you can only imagine how holding two would make you feel.